# combolite-core C99 formatting — calibrated to the existing tree. New/changed code
# must be clang-format-clean (CI: `clang-format --dry-run -Werror` on the diff). A
# small amount of intentional hand-formatting (packed byte-tables, grouped short
# assignments) is guarded with `// clang-format off/on`. See db-combolite/CLAUDE.md.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Right
DerivePointerAlignment: false
BreakBeforeBraces: Linux
BreakBeforeBinaryOperators: NonAssignment
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine: true
AlignAfterOpenBracket: Align
AlignEscapedNewlines: Left
SortIncludes: false
KeepEmptyLinesAtTheStartOfBlocks: false
SpaceAfterCStyleCast: false
...
